# System Architecture: toolkit

## System Context (C4 Level 1)

```mermaid
C4Context
    title System Context Diagram - Claude Code Plugin Toolkit

    Person(user, "Developer", "Uses Claude Code with toolkit plugin")
    System(toolkit, "Claude Code Plugin Toolkit", "Provides SDLC automation skills, agents, hooks, and evaluation infrastructure")
    System_Ext(claude, "Claude Code", "Host CLI and execution environment")
    System_Ext(git, "Git", "Version control and worktree management")

    Rel(user, claude, "Invokes skills via /")
    Rel(claude, toolkit, "Loads plugin, executes skills")
    Rel(toolkit, git, "Manages worktrees, commits")
```

## Container Diagram (C4 Level 2)

```mermaid
C4Container
    title Container Diagram - toolkit

    Container(skills, "Agent Skills", "Markdown", "14 skills providing task-specific instructions for Claude")
